          "headline": "India gives 1 crore HPV vaccine doses in under nine months",
          "summary": "Health Minister J P Nadda said India has given 1 crore doses of the free HPV vaccine, which protects against cervical cancer, since the national campaign began less than nine months ago. That covers nearly 87% of this year's eligible 14-year-old girls. Six states, including Gujarat, Uttar Pradesh and Bihar, have reached 100%.",
